Safety
------

The SH03 is a mains-powered appliance that generates heat. Reflashing its
firmware, or powering it with the screen board disconnected, can cause
unintended heating. Anything you do based on this repository is at your own
risk. See the safety notes in README.md and docs/PROTOCOL.md.
